menu "HID Agent configuration"

    config HID_AGENT_RX_DEBUG
        bool "Enable UART0 debug logging (pollutes the JSON protocol stream)"
        default n
        help
            protocol.md §1 requires the firmware to stay silent on UART0, because
            UART0 carries the JSON-lines protocol.  When this option is disabled
            (default) esp_log_level_set("*", ESP_LOG_NONE) is applied and no log
            line can ever be interleaved with protocol frames.

            Enabling it raises the log level of this project's components only
            ("hid_agent", "hid_device", "cmd_proto", "uart_link") to INFO.
            Never enable it while the PC bridge is parsing the port.

endmenu